purposes.body:
Your consent is the main ground for processing (Articles 18 and 21 of the law). Some processing is also needed to provide the service under the Terms or to meet legal duties. We use your data to:

- create and protect your account and sign you in;
- show opportunities and let you apply;
- let organisations review your applications and organise events;
- record attendance, hours, XP and levels;
- accept applications automatically when an organiser chooses this (see “Automatic decisions”);
- send you notifications in the app and, if you connect it, on Telegram;
- show you on the leaderboard, and on a public profile if you turn it on in Settings → Privacy;
- answer your requests and reports;
- keep the platform secure and investigate misuse.

We never sell your data, show advertising or use analytics or advertising trackers. Using your data for a new purpose needs your new consent (Article 19).
